abstract: >-
  FinReport-NLP is an NLP pipeline for extracting target sections from
  large-scale financial reports using spaCy NER and hybrid rule-based methods.
  The final mode7 model was applied to approximately 22,800 plain-text reports.
keywords:
  - NLP
  - financial reports
  - information extraction
  - spaCy
